[I] Composable keyword argument cycling library

[T] A library for composable keyword argument cycling. Primarily
[T] used in data visualization (especially with Matplotlib) to
[T] automatically iterate over style properties like colors, line
[T] styles, markers, etc.

[U] https://github.com/matplotlib/cycler

[A] Matplotlib Authors
[M] Paul Manners <paul.manners@yahoo.com>

[C] extra/tool
